                                "sense_id": "6b17db61-cadf-3047-bd97-bd3fc4134148",
                                "text": "The Manelis and Tharp ( 1977 ) investigation failed to find a difference between affixed and nonaffixed words in either direction, a result that favored the independent entries hypothesis over either version of the decompositional hypothesis."
